  "description": "CONTACT DERMOT LYNCH TO ARRANGE A VIEWING 0872622382\n\n***  70 WHITEOAKS, WILTON, CORK  ***\n\nDan Howard & Co. Ltd Auctioneers are delighted to present this lovely 3-bedroom mid-terrace home located in the ever-popular Whiteoaks development in Wilton, Cork.\n\nThis property enjoys a superb location in one of Cork’s most established and sought-after residential areas. It will appeal to first-time buyers, families, and investors alike — particularly as there is no rental history attached, offering a fresh opportunity for owner-occupiers.\n\nThe property benefits from a large rear garden, providing excellent potential to extend (subject to planning permission) and create additional living space if desired.\n\nInternally, the accommodation is well laid out and comprises a welcoming living room and kitchen/dining room on the ground floor. Upstairs, there are three bedrooms and a main bathroom.\n\nWhiteoaks is ideally positioned within walking distance of Wilton Shopping Centre and in close proximity to Cork University Hospital, MTU, excellent schools, public transport links and with easy access to Cork City Centre and the South Link Road Network.\n\nThis is a fantastic opportunity to secure a home in a mature and convenient location.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended.\n\nAccommodation\n\nHallway:\nWelcoming entrance hallway.\n\nSitting Room:\nBright and comfortable living space to the front of the property.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room:\nSpacious kitchen/dining area with access to the rear garden.\n\nStairs & Landing\n\nBedroom 1:\nGenerous double bedroom.\n\nBedroom 2:\nDouble bedroom overlooking the rear garden.\n\nBedroom 3:\nSingle bedroom ideal for home office or nursery.\n\nBathroom:\nMain family bathroom.\n\n To arrange a viewing, contact Dan Howard & Co. Ltd Auctioneers today.",
